>>
Rule 1 (tensor must be 3D, 4D, or 5D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 3) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 4) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 5)
>>
Rule 2 (dim 0 must be divisible by groups and groups must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) % v_2 = 0
>>
Rule 3 (groups should not exceed the size of dim 0)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 ≤ shape(v_1, 0)
>>
Rule 4 (tensor must have floating-point or complex dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 5 (spatial kernel dimensions must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [2, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
